    athkar_qunut_i1: 'O Allah, You alone we worship, and to You we pray and prostrate; to You we hasten and strive. We hope for Your mercy and fear Your punishment; indeed Your punishment overtakes the disbelievers. O Allah, we seek Your help and Your forgiveness, and we praise You with good, and we are not ungrateful to You. We believe in You, submit to You, and disown whoever disbelieves in You.',
    athkar_rain_i1: 'O Allah, I ask You for its good, and I seek refuge in You from its evil.',
    athkar_sleep_i1: 'O Allah, You created my soul and You take it; to You belong its death and its life. If You keep it, protect it; and if You take it, forgive it. O Allah, I ask You for wellbeing.',
    athkar_sleep_i2: 'O Allah, Lord of the seven heavens and Lord of the earth, Lord of the Mighty Throne, our Lord and Lord of all things, Splitter of the seed and the date-stone, Revealer of the Torah, the Gospel, and the Criterion: I seek refuge in You from the evil of every thing whose forelock You seize. O Allah, You are the First, so nothing is before You; and You are the Last, so nothing is after You; and You are the Manifest, so nothing is above You; and You are the Hidden, so nothing is beyond You. Settle our debt for us and free us from poverty.',
    athkar_sleep_i3: 'All praise is for Allah who fed us, gave us drink, sufficed us, and gave us shelter — for how many have none to suffice them or shelter them.',
    athkar_sleep_i4: 'There is no god but Allah, the One, the Subduer, Lord of the heavens and the earth and all between them, the Mighty, the Ever-Forgiving.',
    athkar_travel_i1: 'I entrust you to Allah, whose trusts are never lost.',
    athkar_travel_i2: 'I entrust to Allah your religion, your trust, and the outcomes of your deeds.',
    athkar_travel_i3: 'May Allah provide you with piety, forgive your sin, and make good easy for you wherever you are.',
    athkar_travel_i4: 'A witness has borne witness to the praise of Allah and His good favour upon us. Our Lord, accompany us and bestow Your favour upon us, seeking refuge in Allah from the Fire.',
    athkar_waking_i1: 'All praise is for Allah who gave us life after He caused us to die, and to Him is the resurrection.',
    athkar_waking_i2: 'All praise is for Allah who restored my body to health, returned my soul to me, and permitted me to remember Him.',
    athkar_waswas_i6: 'I seek refuge in the perfect words of Allah, which neither the righteous nor the wicked can surpass, from the evil of what He created, originated, and multiplied; from the evil of what descends from the sky and what ascends into it; from the evil of what He scattered in the earth and what comes out of it; from the evil of the trials of night and day; and from the evil of every visitor by night, save one who comes with good, O Most Merciful.',
    athkar_wedding_i1: 'In the name of Allah. O Allah, keep Satan away from us, and keep Satan away from what You provide us.',
    athkar_wudu_i1: 'I bear witness that there is no god but Allah alone, without partner, and I bear witness that Muhammad is His servant and Messenger.',
    athkar_wudu_i2: 'O Allah, make me of those who turn to You in repentance, and make me of those who purify themselves.',
