    help_athkar_toggle: "Larabci: yana nuna rubutun thikr da Larabci ne kawai.\nRubutun Sauti: yana ƙara furucin Latin da fassara a cikin yaren da kuka zaɓa.",
    help_athkar_favourites: "Matsa tsawo a kan kowace ƙungiya don ƙarawa ko cire ta daga Abubuwan da Ake So. Abubuwan da ake so suna bayyana da farko kuma ana nuna su da launi na zinari.",
    help_athkar_counter: "Taɓa duk inda kake a kan katin thikr don ƙidaya. Katin yana kammala ta atomatik lokacin da kuka kai adadin da ake buƙata kuma yana ci gaba zuwa thikr mai zuwa.",
    help_athkar_language: "Wannan yana canza yaren fassara don Athkar ne kawai. Ba ya shafar saitunan yare na farko na aikace-aikacen.",
