    athkar_sleep_baqarah: "Ƙarshen ayoyi biyu na Sūrat al-Baqarah (2:285–286). Manzon Allah ﷺ ya ce: wanda ya karanta ƙarshen ayoyi biyu na Al-Baqarah da dare, sun isa masa.",
    athkar_sleep_subhan: "Tsarki ga Allah. (33×) — Manzon Allah ﷺ ya ce: shin ba za zan gaya muku wani abu mafi alheri fiye da bawa ba? Lokacin da kuke zuwa gado, ce Subḥānallāh sau 33, Alḥamdulillāh sau 33 da Allāhu Akbar sau 34 — wannan ya fi muku alheri fiye da bawa.",
